error[L0702]: `work` cannot be popped while a `for` loop goes over it
  --> tests/check/stack_roots.lym:29:25
   |
28 |     for item in work
   |                 ---- the loop goes over it here
29 |         constant done = pop(variable work)
   |                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this takes the top element off `work`
   |
help: to take each element off in turn, loop with `while length(work) > 0` and `pop` inside it

