error[L0702]: `work` cannot be popped while `window`, a view of it, is still used
  --> tests/check/stack_roots.lym:43:21
   |
42 |     constant window = slice(work, 0, 1)
   |              ------ `window` shows `work`
43 |     constant done = pop(variable work)
   |                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this frees the top element, which `window` can show
   |
help: finish with `window` before `work` changes, or copy what `window` shows into a list of its own

